    "plan_update_summary": "### Cycle #41 Quantitative Review & Parameter Mutation\nPhase 2 Out-of-Sample testing with DeepSeek V4.1 Flash demonstrated strong alpha generation over the Phase 1 baseline (lifting Profit Factor from 0.81 to 0.99 and generating +\u20b947.31 in Gross P&L), with net profitability impeded strictly by \u20b948.66 in transaction fees. Root-cause forensics revealed 0.65% stop-loss whipsaws in mid-morning Metals (`TATASTEEL`) and fee drag turning gross-positive breakeven/EOD exits (`ICICIBANK`, `TATASTEEL`) into net losses. For Cycle #42, we are widening `min_sl_pct` to `0.72%` to absorb 5-minute order-book noise, increasing `min_sweep_vol_multiplier` to `2.65x` to filter out low-conviction mid-day sweeps, expanding `min_target_pct` to `1.40%` to improve net payoff over statutory fees, and tightening `breakeven_trigger_r` to `1.05R` to lock in risk-free cushion earlier in the impulse wave."
